LOOPS in C:
   Whenever we want to run a set of instruction for n numbers of time we are use loops
  So,the loop has two types
  1) Entry control loops
  2) exit control loop
  
  //entry control loops//
  1)for
  2)while

  for LOOP:

  FIND NETURALS NUMBERS USING for LOOP:

  #include <stdio.h>
int main()
{
     int i,n;
     scanf("%d",&n);
    for(i=1;i<=n;i++)
    printf("%d\n",i);
}

